(138, 0, 'I had a truly outstanding experience working with Tamer Terkmani from Amaken Real Estate. From the first interaction, Tamer was professional, knowledgeable, and genuinely committed to helping me find the right property. He took the time to understand my needs, offered valuable insights about the market, and guided me through every step of the process with honesty and transparency.\r\n\r\nWhat really stood out was his responsiveness and attention to detail—he was always available to answer questions and ensured everything went smoothly from start to finish. Tamer made what can often be a stressful experience feel seamless', '1', '4', '2025-06-14 11:32:33', '', '34', 'razahasnain0300@gmail.com', 'tamerterkmani8@gmail.com', '1', '1', '0'),
(141, 85, 'I had an excellent experience with Amaken Real Estate. Their team is highly professional, knowledgeable, and genuinely committed to helping clients find the right property. From the initial consultation to the final deal, everything was handled smoothly and transparently.\r\n\r\nWhat impressed me the most was their attention to detail and understanding of market trends. They provided honest advice, quick responses, and made the entire process stress-free. Whether you are buying, selling, or investing, they guide you with confidence and clarity.\r\n\r\nI highly recommend Amaken Real Estate to anyone looking for reliable and trustworthy real estate services. Definitely a 5-star experience!', '1', '5', '2026-03-30 11:59:09', '', NULL, 'hasnainsyedraza0300@gmail.com', 'info@company.com', '1', '1', '0');

