(22, 'Syed Hasnain', 'Raza', 'razahasnain0300@gmail.com', '+971552615993', '+971566583996', 'Driven by structure and innovation, our Admin Manager and Web Developer form a vital duo behind Amaken Real Estate’s operational and digital excellence. While one ensures seamless internal workflows and efficient coordination, the other crafts a modern, secure, and user-friendly online presence. Together, they support both the day-to-day operations and long-term digital growth of the company. Their combined efforts reflect our commitment to professionalism, technology, and client satisfaction.', 'Team', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '../uploads/member_e98210eb1495bc85.jpeg', 'IT Engineer / Marketing Manager'),
(23, 'Marlyn', 'Policarpio', 'marpolicarpio1265@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, 'A meticulous and trustworthy finance professional ensuring accuracy, compliance, and transparency in all financial matters. Skilled in budgeting, reporting, and financial analysis to support sound decision-making and business growth. Maintains clean records, monitors transactions, and safeguards financial health with precision. A key contributor to the financial integrity and stability of Amaken Real Estate.', 'Team', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '../uploads/marllyn.jpg', 'Accountant'),
(28, 'Essa', 'Almulla', 'sms.auh@gmail.com', '+971564924444', '+971564924444', 'A visionary leader with a deep understanding of real estate dynamics, always striving to shape communities with purpose and foresight. Known for turning challenges into opportunities, and ideas into impactful developments. Passionate about creating lasting value for clients, partners, and investors alike. Guided by innovation, integrity, and a relentless pursuit of excellence.', 'leader', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '../uploads/member_87e7c795e034a81b.webp', 'CEO'),
(29, 'Mahmood', 'Abdulrahim', 'info@amaken-realestate.com', '0552615993', '0552615993', 'With over three decades of dedicated expertise and proficiency, I served as VP-Treasury & Taxation at EMIRATES GROUP for 27 years. During my tenure with the \r\nEmirates Group, I officially represented them with government bodies like the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, the Central Bank of the UAE, and Ministry of Finance and was also responsible for strategic and operational support in liquidity management, internation taxation, and cash management, including investments and banking. Managed core Treasury risks, engaged with presidents, and developed contracts. I am responsible for managing all Emirates Group Bank accounts and managing fund repatriations from over 90 Countries. A core member of the Emirates Global Cash Management Program, managing relationships with globale banking partners and influencing process changes. \r\nI also hold experience working as Group CFO at BELHASA INTERNATIONAL for four years, handling IPOs, funding , project evaluations, and liaising with Federal Tax Authorities', 'leader', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '../uploads/member_61e56696b7561d66.webp', 'CFO');

