(73, 0, 'Ajman Creek Towers – Modern Residential Living in Ajman', '<p>Welcome to&nbsp;<strong>Ajman Creek Towers</strong>, where contemporary living meets comfort in the vibrant heart of Ajman. This residential development offers a seamless blend of modern architecture and luxurious interiors, ensuring a sophisticated urban lifestyle.</p>\r\n<p>Designed with elegance in mind, these residences offer expansive living spaces that invite relaxation and social gatherings alike. Every detail has been carefully considered to provide residents with the ultimate living experience.</p>\r\n<p>The kitchens, equipped with modern appliances and abundant counter space, are perfect for both casual cooking and hosting dinner parties. The bathrooms feature sleek fixtures and generous layouts, providing a tranquil retreat from the busy outside world.</p>\r\n<table class=\"has-fixed-layout\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Booking</td>\r\n<td>10% + 4% DLD fee</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>1st Payment</td>\r\n<td>10%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>2nd Payment</td>\r\n<td>10%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>3rd Payment</td>\r\n<td>10%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>33 Month After Reservation (18 installments)</td>\r\n<td>56.7% (per 3 months 3.15%)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>22nd Payment</td>\r\n<td>3.3%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Handover: Q4 2026</strong></h3>', 'Apartment', 'Open', 'sale', '1, 2 & 3', '1 - 4', '0 - 1', '1 - 3', '0 - 1', 'Not specified', 'Starting 891', '610,520 Starting Price', 'Ajman', 'Ajman', 'UAE', '<p>Gymnasium</p>\r\n<p>Kid\'s Play Area</p>\r\n<p>Swimming Pool</p>\r\n<p>Yoga &amp; Meditation</p>', 'Ajman-Creek-Towers-01.jpg', 'Ajman-Creek-Towers-08.png', 'Ajman-Creek-Towers-11.png', 'Ajman-Creek-Towers-15.png', 'Ajman-Creek-Towers-22.png', '0', 'available', 'Ajman-Creek-Towers-24.png', 'Ajman-Creek-Towers-32.png', 'Ajman-Creek-Towers-29.png', 'Not specified', '1', '21-Jun-2025', '', '', '', 'Off Plan', '0', '672979', 'Partially Furnished', '1', '1', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zgRLgtdMy2o&t=7s', '', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/17NdOMMwERblNIEGkdTUbH2-iwaDtl2PH/view?usp=sharing', '1', '0', 'razahasnain0300@gmail.com', ''),
(74, 0, 'Binghatti Twilight – Stylish Apartments in Dubai’s Emerging Hotspot', '<h3 data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"194\"><strong data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"194\">Dubai&rsquo;s Ultimate Investment Opportunity Has Arrived</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"586\"><strong data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"218\">Binghatti Twilight</strong> is the newest residential launch from Binghatti, strategically located in the vibrant and rapidly evolving district of <strong data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"351\">Al Jaddaf</strong>. Situated adjacent to the iconic <strong data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"402\">Versace Hotel</strong>, this exceptional development offers a fusion of striking design, a central location, and captivating views&mdash;positioning it among the most promising real estate opportunities in Dubai.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"750\">Perfectly placed near key destinations and commercial hubs, Binghatti Twilight is crafted to provide a lifestyle that combines ease, elegance, and enduring value.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"755\" />\r\n<h3 data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"807\"><strong data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"807\">Unmatched Connectivity in a Prime Location</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"1030\">Located in the heart of Al Jaddaf, Binghatti Twilight offers seamless connectivity to all corners of the city. Whether you\'re commuting to work, shopping, or exploring Dubai&rsquo;s attractions, you\'re always just minutes away.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1063\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1063\"><strong data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1061\">3 minutes to Dubai Mall</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1089\"><strong data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1087\">Near Business Bay</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1148\"><strong data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1148\">Direct routes to Al Khail Road and Sheikh Zayed Road</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1271\">This well-connected location is ideal for professionals, travelers, and families who value accessibility and convenience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1276\" />\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1328\"><strong data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1328\">Signature Design Meets Contemporary Living</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1632\">Binghatti Twilight features an exclusive range of <strong data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1421\">1, 2, and 3-bedroom luxury residences</strong>. Each apartment is meticulously designed with open-plan layouts, upscale finishes, and premium materials. The architecture proudly showcases Binghatti&rsquo;s signature aesthetic&mdash;where innovation meets visual impact.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1732\">Residents will enjoy an elevated lifestyle that merges sophistication, comfort, and functionality.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1737\" />\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1783\"><strong data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1783\">Panoramic Views from Every Residence</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1934\">A defining feature of Binghatti Twilight is the sweeping, uninterrupted views offered from every unit. Residents can take in the stunning scenery of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1992\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1954\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1954\"><strong data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1954\">Burj Khalifa</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1972\"><strong data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1972\">Dubai Creek</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"1992\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"1992\"><strong data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"1992\">Festival City</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2113\">These spectacular vistas enrich the overall living experience while boosting the property&rsquo;s long-term investment value.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2118\" />\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2181\"><strong data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2181\">An Intelligent Investment with Flexible Payment Plans</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2416\">Starting from <strong data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2218\">AED 1.299 million</strong>, Binghatti Twilight offers luxury living at a competitive price. The development also includes an investor-friendly <strong data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2357\">70/30 payment plan</strong>, making it easier to secure your dream home or investment.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2531\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2455\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2455\"><strong data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2453\">Prices starting at AED 1.299M</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2496\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2496\"><strong data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2494\">Flexible 70/30 payment structure</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2531\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2531\"><strong data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2531\">Anticipated handover in 2027</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2636\">This plan offers a well-balanced path to property ownership in one of Dubai&rsquo;s most desirable locations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2641\" />\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2680\"><strong data-start=\"2647\" data-end=\"2680\">Why Choose Binghatti Twilight</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"3029\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2714\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2714\">Premier location in Al Jaddaf</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2753\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2753\">Luxury 1, 2 &amp; 3-bedroom apartments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2815\">Iconic views of Burj Khalifa, Dubai Creek &amp; Festival City</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2860\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2860\">Minutes from Dubai Mall and Business Bay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2899\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2899\">Easy access to major road networks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2946\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"2946\">Distinctive Binghatti architectural design</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2999\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2999\">Attractive pricing with flexible payment options</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3029\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3029\">Completion expected in 2027</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3288\">Whether you&rsquo;re searching for a new residence or a high-yield real estate investment, <strong data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3138\">Binghatti Twilight</strong> stands out as a unique opportunity combining visionary design, urban convenience, and promising potential in one of Dubai&rsquo;s most dynamic communities.</p>', 'Apartment', 'Open', 'sale', '1, 2 & 3 Bed', '1 - 4', '0 - 1', '1', '0 - 1', 'Not specified', '905.68 Starting', '1,299,000 Starting ', 'Dubai', 'Dubai ', 'UAE', '<p><strong data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"228\">4 Basement Levels</strong> &ndash; Dedicated parking and services</p>\r\n<p><strong data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"282\">Ground Floor</strong> &ndash; Main entrance lobby, retail or reception space</p>\r\n<p><strong data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"355\">3 Podium Levels</strong> &ndash; Parking and facility access</p>\r\n<p><strong data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"420\">3 Commercial Office Floors</strong> &ndash; Premium office spaces</p>\r\n<p><strong data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"470\">1 Mixed-Use Floor</strong> &ndash; Combination of office and residential units</p>\r\n<p><strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"546\">18 Residential Floors</strong> &ndash; Contemporary 1, 2 &amp; 3-bedroom apartments</p>\r\n<p><strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"614\">Mechanical Floor</strong> &ndash; Building systems and utilities</p>\r\n<p><strong data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"666\">Roof Level</strong> &ndash; Potential for amenities such as rooftop lounge or terrace views</p>\r\n<p>Parking Space</p>\r\n<p>Pet-Friendly Community</p>\r\n<p>Smart Home Integration</p>\r\n<p>Common Gym</p>\r\n<p>Swimming Pool</p>\r\n<p>Retail Shops</p>\r\n<p>Office Spaces</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"361\"><strong data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"345\">Burj Khalifa &amp; Downtown Dubai</strong> &ndash; 3&ndash;5 minutes</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"395\"><strong data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"379\">Dubai Opera</strong> &ndash; 3&ndash;5 minutes</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"432\"><strong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"416\">The Dubai Mall</strong> &ndash; 3&ndash;5 minutes</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"476\"><strong data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"460\">Dubai Design District</strong> &ndash; 5&ndash;8 minutes</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"517\"><strong data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"500\">Meydan Racecourse</strong> &ndash; 5&ndash;10 minutes</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"571\"><strong data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"554\">Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary</strong> &ndash; 5&ndash;10 minutes</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"614\"><strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"598\">Museum of the Future</strong> &ndash; 4&ndash;6 minutes</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"648\"><strong data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"632\">Dubai Frame</strong> &ndash; 4&ndash;6 minutes</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"685\"><strong data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"669\">Al Jaddaf Walk</strong> &ndash; 2&ndash;3 minutes</p>', '4.PNG', '10.PNG', '11.PNG', '12.PNG', '13.PNG', '0', 'available', '14.PNG', '16.PNG', '3.PNG', 'Not specified', '1', '21-Jun-2025', '', '', '', 'Off Plan', '0', '616471', 'Furnished', '1', '1', '', '', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/139jWYO0V1sk17XCF-tIUA7UzMhEo8Yw3/view?usp=sharing', '1', '0', 'razahasnain0300@gmail.com', ''),
(75, 0, 'Aspirz by Danube Properties – Modern Residential Living', '<p><strong>Aspirz by Danube &ndash; Where Urban Living Meets Business Excellence</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Aspirz by Danube</strong> is the future of <strong>urban living and working</strong> in <strong>Dubai Sports City</strong>, offering a revolutionary blend of <strong>premium convertible hotel apartments</strong> and <strong>modern office spaces</strong> under one iconic address. With a thoughtfully planned <strong>structure of 2B + G + 7P + 40 + Roof</strong>, the tower seamlessly separates work and life&mdash;<strong>offices from 2nd to 5th floors</strong>, and <strong>residences from 17th to 40th floors</strong>&mdash;providing both <strong>luxury</strong> and <strong>flexibility</strong> for professionals and families.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Project Highlights</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Fully Furnished Convertible Apartments</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Separate Entrances</strong> for Offices &amp; Residences</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Over 30 Lifestyle Amenities</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Completion Date:</strong> Q4 2028</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Structure:</strong> 2 Basements + Ground + 7 Podiums + 40 Floors + Roof</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Smart Home Features &amp; Multiple Color Themes</strong> (for pre-bookings)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Office Prices</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Standard, Executive, Premier &amp; Prestige</strong> Office Options</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>From <strong>AED 850K</strong>, <strong>AED 1.4M</strong>, to <strong>AED 1.85M</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Residential Prices</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Flex Studio:</strong> AED 850K</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>1 Bedroom:</strong> AED 1.125M</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>1 Bedroom + Flex Plus:</strong> AED 1.35M</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>2 Bedroom Flex Plus:</strong> AED 1.75M</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>3 Bedroom Flex Plus:</strong> AED 2.5M</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Flexible 6.5-Year Payment Plan</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>70% Till Completion</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>30% Post Completion</strong> <em>(1% x 30 Months)</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Pre-Launch Offer:</strong> <strong>0% Interest &ndash; Just 1% per Month</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Submit your EOI today with a Token of AED 50k</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Signature Amenities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🎙️ <strong>Podcast Center</strong> &ndash; A dedicated space for creators and conversations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>☕ <strong>Business Caf&eacute;</strong> &ndash; Fuel ideas and connections in a modern workspace</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🏢 <strong>Business Center</strong> &ndash; Fully equipped for professional productivity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🏊&zwj;♂️ <strong>Infinity Pool</strong> &ndash; Luxury at your doorstep</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🛋️ <strong>Elegant Lobby</strong> &ndash; Where first impressions last</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🔑 <strong>High ROI Potential</strong> &ndash; Prime location, timely delivery, and furnished units</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Aspirz by Danube</strong> is not just a property&mdash;it&rsquo;s a lifestyle designed for the <strong>modern professional</strong>. Invest today in a development that offers <strong>luxury, function, and future-ready living</strong> all in one.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Apartment', 'Open', 'sale', 'Studio, 1,2 & 3BR, Office', '1 - 4', '0 - 2', '1', '1', 'Not specified', 'Not Specified', '850000 Starting', 'Dubai', 'Dubai', 'UAE', '<p>Party Hall cum Conference Hall</p>\r\n<p>HITEC Meeting Theatre</p>\r\n<p>Business Center / Meeting Room</p>\r\n<p>Podcast Center</p>\r\n<p>Indoor Yoga / Zumba</p>\r\n<p>Outdoor Yoga</p>\r\n<p>Outdoor Gym</p>\r\n<p>Gym (Male &amp; Female)</p>\r\n<p>Sauna and Steam</p>\r\n<p>Jacuzzi</p>\r\n<p>Foot Bath</p>\r\n<p>Anti Current Pool</p>\r\n<p>Aquatic Gym</p>\r\n<p>Padel Court</p>\r\n<p>Cricket Pitch</p>\r\n<p>Multi-Purpose Court (Pickleball / Basketball)</p>\r\n<p>Badminton Court</p>\r\n<p>Jogging Track</p>\r\n<p>Multi-Purpose Training Space</p>\r\n<p>Indoor Games (TT / Billiards / Chess)</p>\r\n<p>Wall Climbing</p>\r\n<p>Trampoline</p>\r\n<p>Kids Cycling</p>\r\n<p>BBQ Area</p>\r\n<p>Cabana / Family Seating</p>\r\n<p>Kids Pool</p>\r\n<p>Swimming Pool</p>\r\n<p>Kids Play Area</p>\r\n<p>Kids Nursery</p>\r\n<p>Prayer Hall</p>\r\n<p>Caf&eacute;</p>\r\n<p>Cigar Lounge</p>\r\n<p><strong>2 mins</strong> &ndash; Dubai Cricket Stadium</p>\r\n<p><strong>2 mins</strong> &ndash; Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road</p>\r\n<p><strong>5 mins</strong> &ndash; Schools Nearby</p>\r\n<p><strong>15 mins</strong> &ndash; Dubai Internet City Metro</p>\r\n<p><strong>18 mins</strong> &ndash; Mall of the Emirates</p>\r\n<p><strong>25 mins</strong> &ndash; Dubai International Airport</p>\r\n<p><strong>Fully Furnished Apartments</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Prime Location</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>High Return on Investment</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Timely Delivery</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Attractive Monthly Payment Plan</strong></p>', 'd1.webp', 'd3.webp', 'd4.webp', 'd5.webp', 'd6.webp', '0', 'available', 'd7.webp', 'd8.webp', 'd2.webp', 'Not specified', '1', '22-Jun-2025', '', '', '', 'Off Plan', '0', '462266', 'Furnished', '1', '1', '', '', '', '', '1', '0', 'razahasnain0300@gmail.com', ''),
(76, 0, 'Azizi Milan – Contemporary Apartments in Dubai’s Thriving Community', '<p><strong>Azizi Milan &ndash; Embrace the Timeless Charm of Milan in the Heart of Dubai</strong></p>\r\n<p>Step into a world where Italian sophistication blends seamlessly with Dubai&rsquo;s dynamic energy. <strong>Azizi Milan</strong> offers a refined lifestyle amid the vibrant ambiance of modern Dubai. This exquisite development harmoniously fuses rich cultural charm with contemporary elegance, offering residents a lifestyle that is both luxurious and serene.</p>\r\n<p>Located in a <strong>prime, high-demand area</strong> with exceptional growth potential, Azizi Milan is more than just a residence &ndash; it is a destination of style, comfort, and connection. Stroll along <strong>vibrant retail boulevards</strong>, indulge in <strong>delightful caf&eacute;s and restaurants</strong>, and unwind in <strong>lush botanical gardens</strong>. Whether you\'re savoring gourmet cuisine or admiring the scenic canal views, every detail is designed to elevate your everyday experience.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>✨ <strong>Key Features &amp; Lifestyle Amenities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>📍 <strong>Prime Location</strong> with High Investment Potential</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🛍️ <strong>Multiple Retail Boulevards</strong>, Fashion Districts &amp; Boutique Shopping</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🏙️ <strong>Scenic Canal</strong>, Open Spaces &amp; Leisure Areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🏠 <strong>Wide Selection of Units</strong> &ndash; Studio, 1, 2, and 3-Bedroom Apartments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🎯 <strong>Nearby Attractions</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>IMG Worlds of Adventure &ndash; <strong>1 min</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Cityland Mall &ndash; <strong>4 mins</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Global Village &ndash; <strong>5 mins</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Dubai Miracle Garden &ndash; <strong>15 mins</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Silicon Central Mall &ndash; <strong>15 mins</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Dubai International Airport (DXB) &ndash; <strong>25 mins</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🏢 <strong>Community Facilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Residential neighborhoods</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Hotels and serviced apartments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Healthcare centers &amp; educational institutions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Business center and meeting halls</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Indoor games (Table Tennis, Billiards, Chess)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Indoor Yoga/Zumba zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Prayer Hall</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Podcast Center</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Party Hall &amp; Conference Theatre</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🌿 <strong>Nature &amp; Serenity</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Beautiful Milanese-inspired architecture</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Botanical gardens and green landscapes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Enchanting lighting and canal reflections</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Tranquil surroundings designed for well-being</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🚗 <strong>Excellent Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Easy access via E311 (Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Access from D54 (Sheikh Zayed Bin Hamdan Al Nahyan Street)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Close to IMG Worlds of Adventure and Global Village</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1844\">💰 <strong data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1844\">Flexible Payment Plan</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1903\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1877\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1877\"><strong data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1875\">80% During Construction</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1903\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1903\"><strong data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1901\">20% On Completion</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1991\">This attractive payment schedule offers flexibility for both homeowners and investors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"1996\" />\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2028\">🏢 <strong data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2028\">Project Composition</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2129\">Azizi Milan includes a well-balanced mix of residential offerings designed to suit every lifestyle.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2218\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2152\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2152\"><strong data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2150\">70% Buildings</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2218\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2218\"><strong data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2173\">30% Townhouses</strong> <em data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2218\">(Not included in the initial launch phase)</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2223\" />\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2280\">📊 <strong data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2280\">Apartment Unit Distribution (Buildings Only)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2355\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2355\"><strong data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2299\">70% Studios</strong> &ndash; Ideal for singles, investors, and first-time buyers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2419\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2419\"><strong data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2377\">25% One Bedroom</strong> &ndash; Perfect for couples and professionals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2499\"><strong data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2454\">5% Two &amp; Three Bedroom Units</strong> &ndash; Designed for families and premium buyers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2504\" /><hr />\r\n<h3>🌟 <strong>Why Choose Azizi Milan?</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Azizi Milan is a masterpiece that celebrates <strong>Milanese elegance</strong> with the heartbeat of <strong>Dubai&rsquo;s urban sophistication</strong>. It&rsquo;s a lifestyle where fashion meets nature, where every day is infused with joy, and where every corner invites tranquility and elegance. Whether for living or investment, Azizi Milan offers a world of opportunities wrapped in timeless allure.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Apartment', 'Open', 'sale', 'Studio, 1,2 & 3BR', '1-4', '0 - 1', '1', '0 - 1', 'Not specified', 'Not Specified', '580,000 Starting', 'Dubai', 'Dubai', 'United arab emirate', '<p>🕐 <strong>1 Minute</strong> &ndash; IMG Worlds of Adventure</p>\r\n<p>🛍️ <strong>4 Minutes</strong> &ndash; Cityland Mall</p>\r\n<p>🌍 <strong>5 Minutes</strong> &ndash; Global Village</p>\r\n<p>🌸 <strong>15 Minutes</strong> &ndash; Dubai Miracle Garden</p>\r\n<p>🏢 <strong>15 Minutes</strong> &ndash; Silicon Central Mall</p>\r\n<p>✈️ <strong>25 Minutes</strong> &ndash; Dubai International Airport (DXB)</p>\r\n<p><strong>🚗 Main Access Roads: E311 &ndash; Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>🚗 Main Access Roads: D54 &ndash; Sheikh Zayed Bin Hamdan Al Nahyan Street</strong></p>\r\n<p>🛍️ <strong>Multiple Retail Boulevards</strong></p>\r\n<p>🌊 <strong>Scenic Canal Views</strong></p>\r\n<p>🕌 <strong>Mosque, Private Hospitals, and Hotels</strong></p>\r\n<p>☕ <strong>Delightful Caf&eacute;s and Restaurants at Every Corner</strong></p>\r\n<p>🌿 <strong>Lush Botanical Gardens and Green Landscapes</strong></p>\r\n<p>👗 <strong>Fashion Districts Featuring Elegant Boutiques</strong></p>\r\n<p>🛒 <strong>Onsite Shopping Mall</strong></p>\r\n<p>🎓 <strong>K&ndash;12 School, Nursery, and Kindergarten</strong></p>\r\n<p>🏢 <strong>Dedicated Office Spaces &amp; Business Centres</strong></p>\r\n<p>🏊&zwj;♂️ <strong>Swimming Pools, Saunas &amp; Jacuzzis in Every Building</strong></p>\r\n<p>🎯 <strong>Multipurpose Halls and Game Rooms</strong></p>\r\n<p>🎬 <strong>Cinemas &amp; Lounges</strong></p>\r\n<p>💪 <strong>Stimulating Fitness Centres</strong></p>\r\n<p>🍖 <strong>BBQ Areas for Social Gatherings</strong></p>\r\n<p>👶 <strong>Kids&rsquo; Play Areas</strong></p>\r\n<p>🌸 <strong>Picturesque Gardens for Relaxation</strong></p>', '1.webp', '2.webp', '7.webp', 'Capture.PNG', '13.webp', '0', 'available', '16.webp', '8.webp', '5.webp', 'Not specified', '0', '22-Jun-2025', '', '', '', 'Off Plan', '0', '476216', 'Furnished', '1', '1', '', '', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KDaSl2H0yWJluvjLmE9qcki9qbsaDpzu/view?usp=sharing', '1', '0', 'razahasnain0300@gmail.com', ''),
(77, 0, 'Hamriya Villa – Spacious Family Home in Prime Location', '<p><strong>Prime Investment Opportunity &ndash; Fully Renovated Spacious Villa in Abu Hail, Dubai</strong></p>\r\n<p>💰 <strong>Asking Price:</strong> AED 5.4 Million (Net Price &ndash; Negotiable)<br />📈 <strong>Annual Rental Income:</strong> AED 420,000<br />📍 <strong>Location:</strong> Abu Hail, near Al Mamzar Park, Deira Islands, Dubai Hospital, and Gold Souk</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p>Presenting a <strong>remarkable investment opportunity</strong> in the heart of <strong>Abu Hail</strong>, Dubai &mdash; a <strong>fully renovated, high-yield villa</strong> ideal for families, staff accommodation, or rental income purposes. Located in a strategic and well-connected neighborhood, this villa offers both luxury and functionality, just minutes from key city attractions such as <strong>Al Mamzar Beach Park</strong>, <strong>Deira Islands waterfront development</strong>, <strong>Dubai Hospital</strong>, and the <strong>Gold Souk</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Property Features:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🛏️ <strong>13 Extra-Large Bedrooms</strong> &ndash; Bright and spacious, perfect for families or partitioned rental units</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🛁 <strong>11 Modern Bathrooms</strong> &ndash; Designed for convenience and comfort, with updated fixtures</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🍽️ <strong>Fully Equipped Kitchens</strong> &ndash; Designed to handle multi-family use or staff accommodations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🛋️ <strong>2 Expansive Living Rooms</strong> &ndash; Large open areas suitable for gatherings, recreation, or multi-unit rental setups</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🌇 <strong>2 Oversized Balconies</strong> &ndash; Offering open views and a relaxing outdoor experience</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🔌 <strong>Dual Electricity Meters</strong> &ndash; One for each floor, allowing independent utility usage for upper and lower units</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🚪 <strong>2 Separate Main Entrances from the Street</strong> &ndash; Ideal for privacy or splitting the property into two rental sections</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🏠 <strong>2 Private Internal Entrances</strong> &ndash; Each section of the villa has its own secure access point</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>🛠️ <strong>Recently Renovated</strong> &ndash; Complete refurbishment and maintenance carried out to the highest standards</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Investment Benefits:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>✅ <strong>High ROI</strong> with an existing annual rental income of AED 420,000</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>✅ <strong>Ready to Generate Income</strong> &ndash; No need for renovation or delay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>✅ <strong>Flexible Usage</strong> &ndash; Perfect for family residence, company staff housing, or rental units</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>✅ <strong>Prime Residential Location</strong> &ndash; Easy access to major highways, public transport, schools, hospitals, and shopping areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Located in the well-established neighborhood of <strong>Abu Hail</strong>, this villa sits in close proximity to essential services and entertainment spots while offering peaceful residential living. Whether you are an investor looking for strong returns or a family searching for a large, well-maintained home in the city &ndash; this property offers it all.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Villa', 'Open', 'sale', '11', '13', '2', '1', '2', '2', '6321', '5.4M  Negotiable', '16 13 Street, Abu Hail', 'Dubai ', 'United Arab Emirate', '<p>📍 <strong>Prime Location</strong>: Abu Hail, Dubai &mdash; close to Al Mamzar Park, Deira Islands, Dubai Hospital &amp; Gold Souk</p>\r\n<p>💰 <strong>Net Selling Price</strong>: AED 5.4 Million (Negotiable)</p>\r\n<p>📈 <strong>Rental Income</strong>: AED 420,000 annually &ndash; High ROI</p>\r\n<p>🏠 <strong>Property Type</strong>: Fully Renovated Independent Villa</p>\r\n<p>🛏️ <strong>Bedrooms</strong>: 13 Large and Bright Rooms</p>\r\n<p>🛁 <strong>Bathrooms</strong>: 11 Upgraded, Modern Bathrooms</p>\r\n<p>🍽️ <strong>Kitchens</strong>: Fully Equipped, Ideal for Multi-Family Use</p>\r\n<p>🛋️ <strong>Living Rooms</strong>: 2 Extra-Large Halls Suitable for Family Gatherings or Partitioning</p>\r\n<p>🌇 <strong>Balconies</strong>: 2 Spacious Balconies with Open Views</p>\r\n<p>🛠️ <strong>Renovation</strong>: Recently Fully Renovated &amp; Maintained</p>\r\n<p>🔌 <strong>Electricity</strong>: 2 Separate DEWA Meters (Upper &amp; Lower Units)</p>\r\n<p>🚪 <strong>Access Points</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>2 Independent Entrances from the Street</p>\r\n<p>2 Private Entrances for Each Villa Section</p>\r\n<p>✅ <strong>Ideal for Investors</strong> &ndash; Strong income potential, ready for rental</p>\r\n<p>✅ <strong>Perfect for Families or Staff Housing</strong> &ndash; Large, flexible layout</p>\r\n<p>✅ <strong>Peaceful Residential Environment</strong> &ndash; Safe, well-connected neighborhood</p>\r\n<p>✅ <strong>Proximity to Key Landmarks</strong>:5 mins to Al Mamzar Beach Park, 10 mins to Deira Islands, Close to Dubai Hospital and Gold Souk</p>\r\n<p>✅ <strong>Easy Access to Public Transport &amp; Major Roads</strong></p>\r\n<p>✅ <strong>Split Villa Option</strong> &ndash; Upper and lower levels can be rented separately</p>\r\n<p>✅ <strong>Clean Title &amp; Ownership Documentation Available</strong></p>', '1 (1).jpg', '5 (1).jpg', '2 (1).jpg', '4 (1).jpg', '8.jpg', '0', 'available', '7.jpg', '10.jpg', '9.jpg', '2', '1', '24-Jun-2025', '', '', '', 'Ready to Move', '1', '591626', 'Partially Furnished', '1', '1', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/13NguBWHeHFUyQy_LHV-gAGSaJARd3E8E/view?usp=drive_link', '', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TMYd6fr1ZDuqD03rxOatA0L09fKsT7Sj/view?usp=drive_link', '1', '0', 'razahasnain0300@gmail.com', ''),
(79, 0, 'Luxury 5BR Villa for Sale in Ajmal Makan – Thuraya Island', '<h3><strong>Seabreeze Villas &ndash; 5-Bedroom Luxury Villas at AlThuraya Island, Ajmal Makan</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>Experience island living at its finest.</strong><br />Welcome to <strong>Seabreeze Villas</strong>, a limited collection of <strong>5-bedroom luxury villas</strong> located in the heart of <strong>AlThuraya Island</strong>, within the prestigious <strong>Ajmal Makan Sharjah Waterfront City</strong>. Offering a harmonious blend of modern design and serene natural beauty, these homes are set along the community\'s lush green spine with scenic park views and vibrant boulevards.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Villa Highlights:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Plot Area</strong>: 3,868 &ndash; 5,133 sq. ft</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Built-Up Area (BUA)</strong>: 6,596 sq. ft</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>5 Bedrooms</strong> &ndash; All en-suite</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Spacious Living Room</strong> + Family Lounge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Formal Dining Area</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Fully Equipped Branded Kitchen</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Maid&rsquo;s Room with Bathroom</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Powder Room + Laundry + Storage Room</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Private Elevator</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>4 Expansive Terraces</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Private Swimming Pool</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>2 Covered Parking Spaces</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Premium Community Amenities:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Private Beach Access</strong> &amp; Waterfront Views</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>High-End Fitness Center</strong> &amp; Wellness Spa</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Cycling Trails &amp; Jogging Tracks</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Water Sports &amp; Outdoor Activities</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Retail Outlets, Caf&eacute;s &amp; Fine Dining</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>24/7 Gated Security &amp; CCTV Surveillance</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Ample Visitor Parking Throughout the Community</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Specifications &amp; Finishes:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Solar Water Heater System</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Smart Home Automation</strong> (Video Intercom, Home Controls)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Branded Kitchen Appliances</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Marble Finishes &amp; Premium Porcelain Tiles</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Top-Grade Doors, Windows, and Sanitary Fittings</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Bathtubs or Shower Boxes in All Bathrooms</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Prime Connectivity:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>2 mins to <strong>Umm Al Quwain Road</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>8 mins to <strong>Mohammed Bin Zayed Road</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>11 mins to <strong>Emirates Road</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>22 mins to <strong>Sharjah International Airport</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>35 mins to <strong>Dubai International Airport</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Future Access</strong>: Water Taxi &amp; Union Train Station</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Why Invest in Seabreeze Villas?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Freehold property in Sharjah for all nationalities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Located in an eco-friendly smart city by <strong>Ajmal Makan</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Strong ROI &amp; capital growth potential</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Ideal for both <strong>end-users</strong> and <strong>investors</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p>📞 <strong>Schedule Your Private Tour Today</strong><br />Own a piece of island paradise. Contact us to learn more about floor plans, availability, and payment plans for <strong>Seabreeze Villas at AlThuraya Island</strong>.</p>', 'Villa', '5 BHK', 'sale', '5', '5', '4', '1', '1', 'Not specified', '6,596.12', '4200000 Starting', 'Al Hamriyah Sharjah', 'Sharjah', 'United Arab Emirate', '<p>5 spacious bedrooms with ensuite bathrooms</p>\r\n<p>Built-up area of 6,596.12 sq. ft</p>\r\n<p>Plot size ranging from 3,868.26 to 5,133.62 sq. ft</p>\r\n<p>Private swimming pool</p>\r\n<p>1 elegant living room</p>\r\n<p>1 family lounge</p>\r\n<p>1 formal dining room</p>\r\n<p>1 branded kitchen with high-end appliances</p>\r\n<p>1 maid&rsquo;s room with ensuite</p>\r\n<p>1 powder room</p>\r\n<p>1 laundry room</p>\r\n<p>1 storage room</p>\r\n<p>4 large terraces</p>\r\n<p>1 private elevator</p>\r\n<p>2 covered parking spaces</p>\r\n<p>Intercom, video system, and home automation features</p>\r\n<p>Access to sandy beach areas within the community</p>\r\n<p>State-of-the-art gym</p>\r\n<p>Luxury spa for relaxation</p>\r\n<p>Scenic cycling and jogging paths</p>\r\n<p>Water activities like kayaking and paddleboarding</p>\r\n<p>On-site retail outlets with premium brands</p>\r\n<p>Fine dining restaurants and caf&eacute;s</p>\r\n<p>Office spaces integrated within the development</p>\r\n<p>Ample visitor and resident parking</p>\r\n<p>24/7 security and surveillance</p>\r\n<p>Easy access to major highways and airports</p>\r\n<p>Future connectivity via water taxi and Union Train</p>\r\n<p>Solar water heater system</p>\r\n<p>Marble finishes in common areas</p>\r\n<p>High-quality porcelain tile flooring</p>\r\n<p>Shower box or bathtub in all bedrooms</p>\r\n<p>Branded premium doors and windows</p>', '11.jpg', 'img1_685d01c75eb1c8.20099091.jpg', '6.jpg', '4.jpg', '5.jpg', '0', 'available', '3.png', 'topmap_685d021f405788.66959976.webp', '1.jpg', 'Not specified', '1', '26-Jun-2025', '', '', '', 'Ready to Move', '0', '665271', 'Furnished', '1', '1', '', '', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yXPJeFs6mU3dnfYHf4dQn7vOdBC-IQna/view?usp=sharing', '1', '0', 'razahasnain0300@gmail.com', ''),
(80, 0, 'Ultra-Luxury 6BR Villa for Sale in Ajmal Makan', '<h2>Serene Villas &ndash; Luxurious 6-Bedroom Villas at AlThuraya Island</h2>\r\n<p>Nestled amidst lush greenery along the central spine of the master plan, the 6-bedroom Serene Villas offer a peaceful retreat from city life. Each villa features a private garden where you can start your day in calm surroundings, and a poolside perfect for unwinding at sunset. These villas combine modern luxury with practicality, featuring state-of-the-art utility rooms, private pools, and elegant walk-in closets to enhance your lifestyle.</p>\r\n<h2>Spacious Living with Premium Comfort</h2>\r\n<p>The villas boast a generous built-up area ranging from 5,351 to 6,949 square feet of plot area, with a built-up area of over 7,000 square feet. They include six ensuite bedrooms, a spacious living room, a family lounge, multiple powder rooms, a fully equipped kitchen with a pantry, and private elevators for ease of access. Additional rooms for maids and drivers with ensuite bathrooms ensure convenience and privacy.</p>\r\n<h2>Exclusive Amenities for a Premium Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>Residents enjoy access to a variety of exclusive amenities designed to enrich their daily living experience. The community offers serene seaside views with sandy beaches, a state-of-the-art gym, a luxurious spa, cycling tracks, and various water activities. Premier retail options including offices, cafes, and restaurants featuring top brands are conveniently located within the community.</p>\r\n<h2>Seamless Connectivity and Accessibility</h2>\r\n<p>Strategically located, Serene Villas provide easy access to key highways and airports. Residents can reach Umm Al Quwain Road within 2 minutes, Mohammed Bin Zayed Road in 8 minutes, Emirates Road in 11 minutes, Sharjah International Airport in 22 minutes, and Dubai International Airport in 35 minutes. Additional transport options include water taxi and union train services.</p>\r\n<h2>A Smart Investment Opportunity</h2>\r\n<p>Investing in Serene Villas means securing your financial future with a stable, high-quality property. The development offers excellent potential for equity growth in an exclusive island community, combining luxury living with promising returns.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Villa', 'Open', 'sale', '6', '6', '6', '1', '1', 'Villa', '7159.08', '7500000', 'Al Hamriyah Sharjah', 'Sharjah', 'United Arab Emirate', '<p>Plot Area: 5,351 to 6,949.05 sq. ft</p>\r\n<p>Built-Up Area (BUA): 7,159.08 sq. ft</p>\r\n<p>6 Bedrooms with ensuite bathrooms</p>\r\n<p>1 Spacious living room</p>\r\n<p>1 Family lounge</p>\r\n<p>3 Powder rooms</p>\r\n<p>1 Laundry room</p>\r\n<p>1 Fully equipped kitchen</p>\r\n<p>1 Pantry room</p>\r\n<p>1 Private elevator</p>\r\n<p>2 Dedicated parking spaces</p>\r\n<p>Private swimming pool</p>\r\n<p>6 Terraces</p>\r\n<p>1 Formal dining room</p>\r\n<p>1 Maid&rsquo;s room with ensuite bathroom</p>\r\n<p>1 Driver&rsquo;s room with ensuite bathroom</p>\r\n<p>Seaside community with sandy beach views</p>\r\n<p>State-of-the-art gym and luxurious spa</p>\r\n<p>Scenic cycling tracks and water activities</p>\r\n<p>Offices, restaurants, cafes, and retail outlets with premium brands</p>\r\n<p>Dedicated parking for every resident</p>\r\n<p>24/7 security and surveillance</p>\r\n<p>Solar water heater system</p>\r\n<p>Branded kitchen appliances</p>\r\n<p>Shower boxes or bathtubs in all bathrooms</p>\r\n<p>High-quality marble and porcelain tile finishes</p>\r\n<p>Branded top-quality doors and windows</p>\r\n<p>Intercom, video system, and smart home automation</p>\r\n<p>Dedicated gallery space blending art and elegance</p>', 'aimage_685d088d73aa57.85663412.jpg', 'aimage1_685d088d748496.48834456.jpg', 'aimage2_685d088d758926.39080119.png', 'aimage3_685d088d76b0f7.59034967.jpg', 'aimage4_685d088d7783a6.72331050.jpg', '0', 'available', 'fimage_685d088d77ed43.21397284.jpg', 'fimage1_685d088d78c2e9.68129801.jpg', 'fimage2_685d088d78f4b0.09047424.jpg', 'Not specified', '1',