(81, 0, 'Ajmal Makan Grandeur Villa – 8-Bedroom Ultra-Luxury Mansion', '<h2><strong>Grandeur Villas at AlThuraya Island &ndash; Redefining Island Living</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Discover the true essence of ultra-luxury living with the <strong>8-bedroom Grandeur Villas</strong>, an exclusive residential collection located on the pristine shores of <strong>AlThuraya Island</strong>. Set against the backdrop of sweeping waterfront views, these magnificent villas offer residents a lifestyle of elegance, space, and serenity.</p>\r\n<p>Every Grandeur Villa is crafted to exude opulence&mdash;featuring a striking modern architectural design that plays with horizontal and vertical elements. From the moment you arrive, you\'re greeted by a bold, playful entrance that opens up to a light-filled, expansive interior seamlessly connected to the beachfront.</p>\r\n<p>With generous living spaces spread across multiple levels, these villas are ideal for large families or individuals who appreciate refined comfort and entertainment-ready layouts. The thoughtful inclusion of private terraces, multiple dining and lounging areas, and a private pool ensures that every moment at home feels like a luxurious retreat.</p>\r\n<p>Perfectly nestled within a self-contained, premium community, Grandeur Villas offer proximity to world-class retail, wellness, and leisure experiences&mdash;all while maintaining a tranquil island ambiance. With seamless access to key roads and transport links, you\'re never far from the pulse of the city, yet always surrounded by calm.</p>\r\n<p>Grandeur Villas are more than just homes&mdash;they&rsquo;re a symbol of prestige, privacy, and a sound investment in your future.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>✨ Premium Amenities &amp; Finishes</strong></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Direct sandy beach access</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Branded kitchen fittings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Solar water heating system</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Shower box or bathtub in every room</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Branded high-quality doors and windows</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Marble surfaces and premium porcelain tiles</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Intercom system, video surveillance, and home automation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Art-inspired private gallery space within villa</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Dedicated private parking for each villa</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>24/7 security and surveillance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>🏙️ Community &amp; Lifestyle Amenities</strong></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>State-of-the-art fitness center</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Luxurious spa and wellness facilities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Cycling and jogging tracks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Water-based activities and beachfront leisure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>On-site restaurants, caf&eacute;s, and branded retail outlets</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Integrated serene community setting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>🚗 Seamless Connectivity</strong></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Umm Al Quwain Road &ndash; 2 minutes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Sharjah International Airport &ndash; 22 minutes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Dubai International Airport &ndash; 35 minutes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Emirates Road &ndash; 11 minutes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Mohammed Bin Zayed Road &ndash; 8 minutes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Accessible via Water Taxi and Union Train</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Villa', 'Open', 'sale', '8', '8', '7', '2', '1', 'Villa', '14,746.56', '12500000', 'Al Hamriyah Sharjah', 'Sharjah', 'United Arab Emirate', '<p>8 Bedrooms with ensuite bathrooms</p>\r\n<p>Built-Up Area: 14,746.56 sq. ft</p>\r\n<p>Plot Area: 10,858.65 to 18,829.00 sq. ft</p>\r\n<p>1 Living Room</p>\r\n<p>1 Majilis</p>\r\n<p>2 Dining Rooms</p>\r\n<p>1 Family Lounge</p>\r\n<p>2 Kitchens</p>\r\n<p>1 Pantry</p>\r\n<p>1 Study Room</p>\r\n<p>1 Laundry Room</p>\r\n<p>1 Storage Room</p>\r\n<p>1 Maid&rsquo;s Room with ensuite</p>\r\n<p>1 Driver&rsquo;s Room with ensuite</p>\r\n<p>Multiple Powder Rooms</p>\r\n<p>7 Private Terraces</p>\r\n<p>1 Private Elevator</p>\r\n<p>3 Covered Parking Spaces</p>\r\n<p>Private Swimming Pool</p>\r\n<p>Direct sandy beach access</p>\r\n<p>Branded kitchen fittings</p>\r\n<p>Solar water heating system</p>\r\n<p>Shower box or bathtub in every room</p>\r\n<p>Branded high-quality doors and windows</p>\r\n<p>Marble surfaces and premium porcelain tiles</p>\r\n<p>Intercom system, video surveillance, and home automation</p>\r\n<p>Art-inspired private gallery space within villa</p>\r\n<p>Dedicated private parking for each villa</p>\r\n<p>24/7 security and surveillance</p>\r\n<p>State-of-the-art fitness center</p>\r\n<p>Luxurious spa and wellness facilities</p>\r\n<p>Cycling and jogging tracks</p>\r\n<p>Water-based activities and beachfront leisure</p>\r\n<p>On-site restaurants, caf&eacute;s, and branded retail outlets</p>\r\n<p>Integrated serene community setting</p>', 'aimage_685d4887360c89.14091136.jpg', 'aimage1_685d4887365b28.51378545.jpg', 'aimage2_685d488736ca15.03269766.jpg', 'aimage3_685d488736fb42.87335123.jpg', 'aimage4_685d4887376f22.29001296.jpg', '0', 'available', 'fimage_685d4887379dc9.64101699.png', 'fimage1_685d4887389930.25605289.jpg', 'fimage2_685d488738f859.15104726.jpg', 'Not specified', '1', '26-Jun-2025', '', '', '', 'Ready to Move', '0', '535487', 'Furnished', '1', '1', '', '', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/18e64TiVVEz69k0OCUw2mHZmCD-I2W6WV/view?usp=sharing', '1', '0', 'razahasnain0300@gmail.com', '');
