(82, 0, 'Ajmal Makan Majestic Mansion 8 Bedroom', '<h2><strong>Majestic Mansion &ndash; The Epitome of Waterfront Luxury Living</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Situated in the most prestigious location on AlThuraya Island, the <strong>Majestic Mansion</strong> is an ultra-luxury 8-bedroom villa designed for those who seek a refined lifestyle. With breathtaking waterfront vistas and thoughtfully crafted interiors, this iconic residence blends nature, architecture, and comfort into a masterpiece of living.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>Elegant Design with Grand Interiors</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Spread across a built-up area of <strong>25,758.04 sq. ft</strong> and plot sizes ranging from <strong>25,369.38 to 37,773.80 sq. ft</strong>, every inch of the Majestic Mansion is a celebration of space and elegance. The mansion features 8 expansive bedrooms with ensuite bathrooms, complemented by premium fittings and natural light flowing through the central atrium.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>Spacious and Functional Layouts</strong></h2>\r\n<p>This luxurious home boasts a well-organized floor plan including:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>A <strong>majlis</strong>, guest lounge, and formal living room</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Two modern kitchens</strong> equipped with branded appliances</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Two dining rooms</strong> for hosting elegant meals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>A <strong>family lounge</strong>, <strong>kids lounge</strong>, and a <strong>study room</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Every space is designed for functionality and opulence, making it perfect for family living and entertaining guests.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>Dedicated Service &amp; Utility Areas</strong></h2>\r\n<p>To support a seamless lifestyle, the mansion includes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Two maid&rsquo;s rooms with ensuite</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>One driver&rsquo;s room with ensuite</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>A <strong>laundry room</strong>, <strong>storage room</strong>, and <strong>pantry</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>A private <strong>elevator</strong> connecting all floors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Four covered parking spaces</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>Exclusive Outdoor Experiences</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy nature and leisure with thoughtfully designed exterior spaces. The villa offers:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>A <strong>private swimming pool</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Eight terraces</strong> overlooking lush gardens and waterfront views</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>A <strong>sunken seating area</strong>, <strong>two exterior seating zones</strong>, and a <strong>kids playground</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>A private <strong>gym</strong> for health and wellness</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These outdoor amenities create an oasis of relaxation and recreation within your home.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>Premium Island Amenities</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Residents of Majestic Mansion enjoy unmatched amenities within the AlThuraya Island community, including:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Private sandy beach access</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>State-of-the-art gym</strong> and luxury <strong>spa facilities</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Cycling tracks</strong> and exciting <strong>water sports options</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Restaurants, caf&eacute;s, retail stores</strong>, and premium offices</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This integrated lifestyle ensures every convenience is just steps away.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>Luxury Features and Finishes</strong></h2>\r\n<p>The villa is designed using the highest quality materials and technology, including:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Solar water heating system</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>High-end marble and porcelain tile finishes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Branded kitchens and top-quality fittings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Intercom, video surveillance, and home automation systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Stylish doors, windows, and sanitary fittings in every bathroom</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These features enhance the overall elegance, safety, and efficiency of your home.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>Strategic Location with Seamless Connectivity</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Live in a prime destination that keeps you close to major landmarks:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>2 minutes to Umm Al Quwain Road</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>8 minutes to Mohammed Bin Zayed Road</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>11 minutes to Emirates Road</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>22 minutes to Sharjah International Airport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>35 minutes to Dubai International Airport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Access to <strong>water taxis</strong> and <strong>Union Train</strong> ensures efficient travel options</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>A Smart and Secure Investment</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Owning a Majestic Mansion means more than luxury&mdash;it&rsquo;s a <strong>strategic financial investment</strong>. With rising property values on AlThuraya Island, you&rsquo;re not just buying a home; you&rsquo;re building <strong>equity</strong>, gaining <strong>financial stability</strong>, and securing your <strong>future</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Villa', 'Open', 'sale', '8', '8', '8', '2', '1', 'Villa', '25,758.04', '12500000', 'Al Hamriyah Sharjah', 'Sharjah', 'United Arab Emirate', '<p>8 Bedrooms with Ensuite Bathrooms</p>\r\n<p>Plot Area: 25,369.38 to 37,773.80 sq. ft</p>\r\n<p>Built-Up Area (BUA): 25,758.04 sq. ft</p>\r\n<p>4 Dedicated Parking Spaces</p>\r\n<p>Private Elevator</p>\r\n<p>Central Atrium with Natural Light</p>\r\n<p>8 Private Terraces</p>\r\n<p>High-End Finishes (Marble, Porcelain Tiles, Branded Fixtures)</p>\r\n<p>1 Spacious Living Room</p>\r\n<p>1 Majlis</p>\r\n<p>1 Guest Lounge</p>\r\n<p>2 Dining Rooms</p>\r\n<p>2 Fully Equipped Kitchens</p>\r\n<p>1 Family Lounge</p>\r\n<p>1 Kids Lounge</p>\r\n<p>1 Study Room</p>\r\n<p>2 Powder Rooms</p>\r\n<p>1 Pantry</p>\r\n<p>1 Laundry Room</p>\r\n<p>1 Storage Room</p>\r\n<p>2 Maid&rsquo;s Rooms with Ensuite Bathrooms</p>\r\n<p>1 Driver&rsquo;s Room with Ensuite</p>\r\n<p>Dedicated Laundry, Pantry, and Storage Areas</p>\r\n<p>Private Swimming Pool</p>\r\n<p>Sunken Seating Area</p>\r\n<p>Serene Garden Area</p>\r\n<p>2 Exterior Seating Areas</p>\r\n<p>Kids Playground</p>\r\n<p>Private Gym</p>\r\n<p>Private Sandy Beach Access</p>\r\n<p>State-of-the-Art Gym &amp; Luxury Spa</p>\r\n<p>Scenic Cycling Tracks</p>\r\n<p>Water Activities (within the community)</p>\r\n<p>Retail Outlets, Caf&eacute;s, and Restaurants</p>\r\n<p>Business Offices and Meeting Spaces</p>\r\n<p>24/7 Security</p>\r\n<p>Dedicated Parking for Residents</p>\r\n<p>Solar Water Heating System</p>\r\n<p>Branded Kitchen Appliances</p>\r\n<p>Shower Box or Bathtub in All Bathrooms</p>\r\n<p>High-Quality Porcelain &amp; Marble Finishes</p>\r\n<p>Premium Doors &amp; Windows</p>\r\n<p>Intercom and Video Security System</p>\r\n<p>Smart Home Automation</p>\r\n<p>2 mins to Umm Al Quwain Road</p>\r\n<p>8 mins to Mohammed Bin Zayed Road</p>\r\n<p>11 mins to Emirates Road</p>\r\n<p>22 mins to Sharjah International Airport</p>\r\n<p>35 mins to Dubai International Airport</p>\r\n<p>Access to Water Taxi and Union Train</p>', 'aimage_685e553490b136.86787436.jpg', 'aimage1_685e5534913357.40506830.jpg', 'aimage2_685e5534918a63.93338217.jpg', 'aimage3_685e553491e136.53923316.jpg', 'aimage4_685e5534922a64.37053222.jpg', '34', 'available', 'fimage_685e55349274c0.15224794.jpg', 'fimage1_685e553492ba17.84700734.jpg', 'fimage2_685e553492e442.77340530.jpg', 'Not specified', '1', '27-Jun-2025', '', '', '', 'Ready to Move', '0', '888608', 'Furnished', '1', '1', '', '', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/19LjdggbQm9y9_TkedDErApGZpZbLr1YB/view?usp=sharing', '1', '0', 'razahasnain0300@gmail.com', ''),
(83, 0, 'Ajmal Makan Azura Villa – 6 Bedroom Ultra-Luxury Beachfront Villa', '<h2><strong>Azura Villa &ndash; A Tranquil Retreat by the Shore</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Located on the picturesque AlThuraya Island, the <strong>Azura Villa</strong> offers an elite lifestyle of serenity and elegance. These <strong>6-bedroom waterfront villas</strong> are perfectly positioned along the shoreline, offering exclusive beach access and mesmerizing views of the azure waters. Designed for those who appreciate fine living, Azura Villa combines natural beauty with sophisticated architecture.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>Sophisticated Design with Thoughtful Layouts</strong></h2>\r\n<p>The Azura Villa is thoughtfully designed to strike a balance between privacy and openness. With pronounced frames and linear structures, each villa offers dynamic views while maintaining personal space and comfort. Featuring <strong>a built-up area of 7,167.69 sq. ft</strong> and <strong>plot sizes ranging from 6,415.05 to 8,975.00 sq. ft</strong>, these villas are both spacious and elegant.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>Spacious Interiors for Modern Living</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Every Azura Villa is built for comfort and functionality. The interiors include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>6 generously sized bedrooms</strong> with ensuite bathrooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>A <strong>large living room</strong> and <strong>a cozy family lounge</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>1 modern kitchen</strong> and <strong>a dedicated pantry</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>1 formal dining room</strong> for family gatherings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>1 maid&rsquo;s room</strong> and <strong>1 driver&rsquo;s room</strong>, both with ensuite bathrooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>A private elevator</strong> for seamless movement across floors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>2 powder rooms</strong>, <strong>1 laundry room</strong>, and ample storage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The seamless integration of luxury and utility makes these villas perfect for both everyday living and entertaining guests.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>Private Outdoor Experience</strong></h2>\r\n<p>The villa is designed to bring the outdoors into your daily life. It features:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>A <strong>private pool</strong> for moments of relaxation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Six terraces</strong> offering varied views throughout the day&mdash;from beachside mornings to rooftop stargazing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Direct access to a private beach</strong>, ensuring your days begin and end with natural beauty</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>Premium Amenities Within the Community</strong></h2>\r\n<h3>🌊 <strong>Seaside Serenity</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Enjoy stunning sandy beach views right at your doorstep, in a community where nature meets elegance.</p>\r\n<h3>🧘 <strong>Health &amp; Wellness</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Residents can maintain an active lifestyle with a <strong>fully equipped gym</strong>, <strong>luxurious spa</strong>, <strong>cycling tracks</strong>, and <strong>water activities</strong>&mdash;all within the island community.</p>\r\n<h3>🛍️ <strong>Retail and Leisure</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Experience convenience and sophistication with <strong>premium restaurants, caf&eacute;s, retail outlets, and office spaces</strong> located nearby.</p>\r\n<h3>🚗 <strong>Convenient Parking &amp; Security</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Each villa includes <strong>2 private parking spaces</strong>, and the community ensures <strong>24/7 security</strong>, offering complete peace of mind.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>High-End Specifications &amp; Technology</strong></h2>\r\n<p>The villa comes equipped with top-of-the-line finishes and smart systems:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Solar Water Heating System</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Branded Kitchen Appliances &amp; Fittings</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Shower Box or Bathtub in all Bathrooms</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Premium Marble and Porcelain Tiles</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Top-Quality Doors and Windows</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Intercom, Video Security, and Home Automation System</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These quality features enhance the experience of luxury living while also adding value and comfort.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>Strategic Island Connectivity</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Despite its tranquil setting, Azura Villa offers excellent connectivity:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>2 mins to Umm Al Quwain Road</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>8 mins to Mohammed Bin Zayed Road</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>11 mins to Emirates Road</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>22 mins to Sharjah International Airport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>35 mins to Dubai International Airport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Access to <strong>Water Taxi</strong> and <strong>Union Train</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This perfect location ensures that you\'re always well connected to major hubs while enjoying peaceful island life.</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2><strong>A Safe and Rewarding Investment</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Owning an Azura Villa isn&rsquo;t just about luxury&mdash;it&rsquo;s a <strong>strategic investment</strong>. With the growing appeal of island living, you gain:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Financial Security</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Stable Property Appreciation</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Long-Term Equity Growth</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Your dream home is also your future asset.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Villa', 'Open', 'sale', '6', '6', '6', '1', '1', 'Villa', '7,167.69', '7500000', 'Al Hamriyah Sharjah', 'Sharjah', 'United arab emirate', '<p>6 Bedrooms with Ensuite Bathrooms</p>\r\n<p>Plot Area: 6,415.05 to 8,975.00 sq. ft</p>\r\n<p>Built-Up Area (BUA): 7,167.69 sq. ft</p>\r\n<p>2 Private Parking Spaces</p>\r\n<p>Private Elevator (In-Villa Lift)</p>\