(85, 0, 'Luxury Apartments in Vistara House, Al Furjan Dubai', '<h3><strong>3BR Apartment with Maid&rsquo;s Room &amp; Storage | 4% DLD Waiver | Prime Al Furjan Location</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment for Sale in Vistara House, Al Furjan, Dubai</strong></p>\r\n<p>Discover elevated living in this <strong>spacious 3-bedroom apartment</strong> with <strong>maid&rsquo;s room and private storage</strong>, located in <strong>Vistara House, Al Furjan</strong> &mdash; a premium residential development by <strong>Object 1</strong>, part of the renowned <strong>TSZ Group</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>Designed for modern lifestyles, this apartment features <strong>floor-to-ceiling windows</strong>, an <strong>open-plan layout</strong>, and <strong>high-end finishes</strong>, offering both comfort and elegance in every detail.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Property Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>3 Large Bedrooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Maid&rsquo;s Room</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Private Storage Room</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Contemporary Open Kitchen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Spacious Living &amp; Dining Area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Floor-to-Ceiling Glass Windows</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Premium Finishing &amp; Fittings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Lifestyle Amenities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Rooftop Swimming Pool with Stunning Views</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Fully Equipped Gym &amp; Fitness Area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Sauna and Wellness Zone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Outdoor BBQ &amp; Lounge Area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Indoor Residents&rsquo; Lounge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Kids Play Area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>24/7 Security with Smart Access Control</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Exclusive Offer</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>4% DLD Fee Waiver</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Expected Handover: Q1 2027</strong></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Prime Location &ndash; Al Furjan, Dubai</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Perfectly positioned in the heart of <strong>Al Furjan</strong>, one of Dubai&rsquo;s most connected and family-friendly communities:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>5 mins to <strong>Al Furjan Metro Station</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>10 mins to <strong>Ibn Battuta Mall &amp; Discovery Gardens</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>15 mins to <strong>Dubai Marina &amp; JBR</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>20 mins to <strong>Expo City &amp; Al Maktoum Airport</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Easy access to <strong>Sheikh Zayed Road (E11)</strong> and <strong>Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road (E311)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Ideal for Families &amp; Investors</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re seeking a <strong>modern family home</strong> or a <strong>high-return investment</strong>, Vistara House offers strong capital appreciation and rental potential in one of <strong>Dubai&rsquo;s fastest-growing neighborhoods</strong>.</p>', 'Apartment', '3 BHK', 'sale', '3', '4', '1', '1', '1', 'Not specified', '2,414 ', '3,283,502', 'Vistara House Al Furjan Dubai', 'Dubai ', 'United Arab Emirate', '<p data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"168\">3 Spacious Bedrooms</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"184\">Maid&rsquo;s Room</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"211\">Dedicated Storage Room</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"261\">Contemporary Open-Plan Living and Dining Area</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"264\" data-end=\"314\">Floor-to-Ceiling Windows for Ample Natural Light</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"362\">Premium Finishes and High-Quality Materials</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"388\">Modern Fitted Kitchen</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"411\">Built-in Wardrobes</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"431\">Private Balcony</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"470\">Smart Layout for Functional Living</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"538\">Rooftop Swimming Pool with Lounge Deck</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"578\">Fully Equipp