(88, 0, 'Alta View Skyhomes – Stylish 2-Bedroom Apartment by Object 1 in Prime Dubai', '<h3><strong>ALTA V1EW Skyhomes &ndash; Object 1 2BR</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>\"Life Above It All\" &ndash; District 10, Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC), Dubai</strong></p>\r\n<p>Discover a lifestyle elevated above the ordinary with <strong>ALTA V1EW Skyhomes</strong>, a visionary residential tower located in the heart of <strong>Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)</strong> &ndash; one of Dubai&rsquo;s fastest-growing and most desirable communities. Blending sleek modern architecture with tranquil green surroundings, this iconic project offers a unique balance of luxury, serenity, and connectivity.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>Project Highlights</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Building Configuration</strong>: B+G+5P+2MF+46+R</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Anticipated Handover</strong>: Q4 2028</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Service Charge</strong>: AED 15/Sq.Ft.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Units</strong>: Studio, 1 &amp; 2 Bedrooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Total Floors</strong>: 46</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Smart living, spacious terraces &amp; eco-conscious design</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>The Location &ndash; JVC</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Jumeirah Village Circle is a thriving, family-friendly community known for its affordability, central location, and dynamic lifestyle offerings. Strategically located with direct access to <strong>Downtown Dubai</strong>, <strong>Dubai Marina</strong>, and major highways like Al Khail Road and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road, JVC continues to attract both end-users and investors.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Surrounded by parks, schools, clinics, and shopping centers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Close to Circle Mall, Dubai Hills Mall, Mall of the Emirates</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Nearby attractions include Dubai Miracle Garden, The Walk JBR &amp; Palm Jumeirah</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Leading schools within minutes: Sunmarke, Arcadia, JSS International</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Well-connected hotels: Novotel, M&ouml;venpick, FIVE JVC</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>World-Class Amenities</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Designed to support holistic living, ALTA V1EW Skyhomes features both podium and sky-deck amenities that redefine comfort and recreation.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Podium Amenities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Lagoon-style pool with water slide</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Kids pool, kids play room &amp; outdoor play area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Floating cabanas, Aqua &amp; Sand Oasis</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Clubhouse, gym, BBQ area, CrossFit zone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Outdoor lounges, lush landscaped gardens</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Tennis court, table tennis, gazebo</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Sky Deck Amenities (33rd Floor):</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Sky infinity pool with panoramic views</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Sunken lounge &amp; Sky Leisure Deck</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Relaxation zones designed for breathtaking cityscapes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>Residences Designed for Modern Living</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Apartments are thoughtfully crafted with:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Open-plan kitchens</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Elegant living rooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Cozy bedrooms with premium finishes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Spacious bathrooms and modern fittings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Smart home features integrated throughout</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>Investment Advantage</strong></h4>\r\n<p>JVC is a real estate hotspot with strong rental demand and excellent capital appreciation. ALTA V1EW Skyhomes presents a rare opportunity to invest in one of Dubai&rsquo;s most promising districts.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>High ROI</strong> due to strategic location and rental appeal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Affordable entry point</strong> for investors and end-users</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Golden Visa Eligibility</strong>: Invest $545,000+ and obtain a 10-year UAE Golden Visa for you and your family, unlocking benefits like:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Long-term residency</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Local business operations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>International banking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Access to premium healthcare &amp; education</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Schengen &amp; U.S. visa facilitation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3><strong>Experience Elevated Living</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>ALTA V1EW Skyhomes</strong> is more than a residence &ndash; it\'s a new way of living inspired by light, nature, and the desire for something greater. Whether you\'re a first-time buyer, investor, or someone seeking an inspired lifestyle in Dubai, this is your destination.</p>', 'Apartment', 'Open', 'sale', '2', '3', '0-1', '1', '0-1', 'No Specified', 'from 1,164', '1630000', 'District 10, Jumeirah Village Circle', 'Dubai', 'United Arab Emirate', '<p>Lagoon-Style Swimming Pool with a Water Slide</p>\r\n<p>Kids Pool &amp; Kids Play Room</p>\r\n<p>Outdoor Kids Play Area</p>\r\n<p>Floating Cabanas</p>\r\n<p>Aqua Oasis &amp; Sand Oasis</p>\r\n<p>Clubhouse with Lounge Spaces</p>\r\n<p>Fully Equipped Gym</p>\r\n<p>Outdoor CrossFit Zone</p>\r\n<p>Tennis Court</p>\r\n<p>Table Tennis Area</p>\r\n<p>BBQ Area with Seating</p>\r\n<p>Pool Deck with Sun Loungers</p>\r\n<p>Gazebo &amp; Outdoor Lounge</p>\r\n<p>Lush Landscaped Gardens</p>\r\n<p>Outdoor Showers</p>\r\n<p>Sky Deck Amenities (33rd Floor)</p>\r\n<p>Sky Infinity Pool with 360&deg; City Views</p>\r\n<p>Sky Leisure Deck</p>\r\n<p>Poolside Sunken Lounge</p>\r\n<p>Sky Pool Deck with Sun Loungers</p>\r\n<p>Spacious, Light-Filled Lobby</p>\r\n<p>Retail Spaces on Ground Level</p>\r\n<p>Green Walkways &amp; Relaxation Areas</p>\r\n<p>Smart Home Systems in Residences</p>\r\n<p>Pet-Friendly &amp; Family-Centric Environment</p>\r\n<p>Secure Basement Parking</p>', 'img_686032e8476b77.95166579.png', 'aimage1_68602abc123866.13248186.png', 'aimage2_68602abc127e89.68558407.png', 'aimage3_68602abc12d920.56815734.png', 'aimage4_68602abc1347e0.70838565.png', '0', 'available', 'fimage_68602abc13b859.72076949.png', 'fimage1_68602abc141420.72297480.png', 'fimage2_68602abc147d94.86340191.png', 'No Specified', '1', '28-Jun-2025', '', '', '', 'Off Plan', '0', '707706', 'Furnished', '1', '1', '', '', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/18xT_ZFqBg7Z0rbVQWOws9Qbl9q2gy4W_/view?usp=sharing', '1', '0', 'razahasnain0300@gmail.com', '');
