(104, 0, 'Binghatti Aquarise, Business Bay – Studio to 4BR Apartments from AED 999K | Waterfront Living in Dubai', '<p data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"439\"><strong data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"439\">Experience Elevated Living at Binghatti Aquarise, Business Bay &ndash; Studios to 4-Bedroom Apartments from AED 999,000</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"960\">Binghatti Aquarise is the newest architectural marvel rising in the heart of <strong data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"534\">Business Bay</strong>, Dubai. This 80-storey mixed-use tower offers a range of exquisitely designed residences, including studios, 1 to 4-bedroom apartments, and opulent Royal Suites. With unit sizes ranging from <strong data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"750\">423 to 3,127 sq. ft.</strong>, each home is crafted with attention to detail &mdash; from <strong data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"833\">floor-to-ceiling windows</strong> and <strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"863\">smart home technology</strong> to luxurious finishes like <strong data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"928\">natural oak wood, polished marble</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"959\">brushed brass accents</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1245\">The tower&rsquo;s dynamic orange-and-white fa&ccedil;ade, featuring <strong data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1043\">cantilevered balconies</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1072\">glazed curtain walls</strong>, is inspired by the fluidity of water. Crowned by a stunning <strong data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1148\">sky garden</strong>, Binghatti Aquarise becomes a glowing landmark along the <strong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1221\">Dubai Canal</strong>, especially after dark.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1627\">Residents enjoy <strong data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1298\">partial canal and skyline views</strong>, with access to a vibrant <strong data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1359\">double-height retail promenade</strong>, leisure facilities, and modern conveniences. With a <strong data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1444\">flexible 70/30 payment plan</strong> and starting prices from just <strong data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1490\">AED 999,000</strong>, it&rsquo;s an ideal investment opportunity for both end-users and global investors. <strong data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1627\">Freehold ownership is available to all nationalities.</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1730\">Live in the city&rsquo;s most iconic water-inspired tower and elevate your lifestyle at Binghatti Aquarise.</p>', 'Apartment', 'Open', 'sale', 'Studio, 1 - 4(BR)', '1 - 5', '1+', '1-5', '1+', 'Not specified', 'From 423', 'From 999,000', 'Business Bay', 'Dubai', 'United arab emirate', '<p data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1788\">Tennis Court</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1816\">Multiple Swimming Pools</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1842\">Indoor &amp; Outdoor Gyms</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1861\">Jogging Tracks</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1881\">Kids&rsquo; Play Area</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1913\">Sky Garden with Canal Views</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1934\">Retail Promenade</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1958\">Underground Parking</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1989\">Vehicle-Free Drop-Off Zone</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2019\">24/7 Security &amp; Concierge</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2045\">Smart Home Automation</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2070\">High-Speed Elevators</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2095\">Solar-Ready Rooftops</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2133\">Integrated Storage &amp; Study Spaces</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2178\">Private Plunge Pools (Royal Suites Only)</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2216\">Wrap-Around Terraces (Royal Suites)</p>', 'aimage_686a6e9b4a6b55.37412729.jpg', 'aimage1_686a6e9b4afec1.90170091.jpg', 'aimage2_686a6e9b4b3679.65649957.jpg', 'aimage3_686a6e9b4b6822.00721341.jpg', 'aimage4_686a6e9b4b8fe6.63071439.jpg', '34', 'available', 'fimage_686a6e9b4bbdd0.93635346.jpg', 'fimage1_686a6e9b4c2830.40568453.jpg', 'fimage2_686a6e9b4c5cc5.01272848.jpg', 'Not specified', '0', '06-Jul-2025', '', '', '', 'Off Plan', '0', '446303', 'Unfurnished', '1', '1', '', '', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1p2eh-N4wpWlsXKuGpysQIbmVJJY4KxE7/view?usp=sharing', '1', '0', 'razahasnain0300@gmail.com', ''),
(105, 0, 'Off-Plan Apartments at Binghatti Hills, Barsha South – Studios, 1 & 2 BR from AED 777K', '<p data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"421\"><strong data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"421\">Discover Tranquil Luxury at Binghatti Hills &ndash; Off-Plan Residences in Barsha South Starting from AED 777,777</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"776\">Welcome to <strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"453\">Binghatti Hills</strong>, a visionary off-plan residential development by Binghatti Properties, located in the peaceful and rapidly growing area of <strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"593\">Barsha South</strong>, Dubai. Inspired by the natural contours of rolling hills, this architectural masterpiece redefines urban living with a unique blend of modern design and nature-inspired tranquility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"1096\">Offering <strong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"835\">studios, 1-bedroom, and 2-bedroom apartments</strong> starting from <strong data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"865\">446 sq. ft.</strong>, Binghatti Hills is designed to provide a peaceful sanctuary amidst the city&rsquo;s energy. The fluid wave-like architecture symbolizes unity and balance, creating an organic connection between the structure and its green surroundings.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1469\">This off-plan project features an extensive range of <strong data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1172\">premium amenities</strong>, including private beaches, sky gardens, meditation zones, and a stunning amenity deck that encourages both wellness and recreation. Whether you seek active mornings on the jogging track or quiet evenings in a zen garden, Binghatti Hills delivers a harmonious lifestyle for residents of all ages.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1852\">With a <strong data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">flexible 20/80 payment plan</strong> (20% down payment, 50% during construction, 30% on handover), and <strong data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1630\">freehold ownership available for all nationalities</strong>, Binghatti Hills is a golden opportunity for investors and homeowners alike. Prices start from just <strong data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1746\">AED 777,777</strong>, offering exceptional value in a prime Dubai location close to parks, schools, and healthcare facilities.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1857\" />', 'Apartment', 'Open', 'sale', 'Studio, 1 & 2BR', '1 - 2+', '1+', '1 - 2', '1 - 2+', 'Not specified', 'From 446', 'From 777,777', 'Barsha South', 'Dubai', 'United arab emirate', '<p data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1918\">Private Beach Access</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1934\">Zen Gardens</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1955\">Lush Sky Gardens</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1972\">Tennis Court</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2000\">Multiple Swimming Pools</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2024\">Fully Equipped Gyms</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2053\">Jogging &amp; Walking Tracks</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2073\">Kids&rsquo; Play Area</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2105\">Multi-Purpose Sports Fields</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2133\">Yoga &amp; Meditation Zones</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2160\">Landscaped Open Spaces</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2185\">High-Speed Elevators</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2210\">Smart Access Control</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2240\">24/7 Security &amp; Concierge</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2264\">Underground Parking</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2294\">Retail &amp; Dining Promenade</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2299\" />', 'aimage_686a72411492a8.47940817.jpg', 'aimage1_686a724114d3d8.17943195.jpg', 'aimage2_686a724114f2a2.16103865.jpg', 'aimage3_686a7241151519.48316257.jpg', 'aimage4_686a72411542d9.45892209.jpg', '34', 'available', 'fimage_686a7241156019.68168116.jpg', 'fimage1_686a724