(106, 0, 'Off-Plan Apartments at Binghatti Skyrise, Business Bay – Studios to 3BR from AED 1.03M', '<p data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"413\"><strong data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"413\">Binghatti Skyrise &ndash; Luxury Off-Plan Apartments in Business Bay from AED 1,030,000</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"815\">Welcome to <strong data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"447\">Binghatti Skyrise</strong>, a landmark off-plan development by Binghatti Properties, redefining vertical luxury in <strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"552\">Business Bay</strong>, Dubai. Rising as a trio of striking high-rises with a crystalline fa&ccedil;ade and illuminated crowns, Binghatti Skyrise stands as the <strong data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"709\">first mega-development</strong> in the area, offering panoramic views of <strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"767\">Burj Khalifa</strong>, <strong data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"784\">Dubai Canal</strong>, and the iconic Dubai skyline.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"1139\">This exceptional project features an elegant collection of <strong data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"919\">studios, 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments</strong> starting from <strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"949\">422 sq. ft.</strong>, crafted to deliver the highest standards of comfort and modern sophistication. Every unit is a masterpiece, combining contemporary design with smart space utilization and premium finishes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1479\">Located at the center of one of Dubai&rsquo;s most prestigious districts, Binghatti Skyrise offers seamless access to Downtown Dubai, Sheikh Zayed Road, and Dubai International Airport. The development blends residential comfort with urban convenience, complete with <strong data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1462\">vibrant caf&eacute;s, retail outlets, and waterfront promenades</strong> just steps away.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1749\">With a <strong data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1510\">70/30 payment plan</strong> (20% down payment, 50% during construction, and 30% on handover), and <strong data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1625\">freehold ownership for all nationalities</strong>, Binghatti Skyrise presents a rare opportunity to own luxury property in one of the city&rsquo;s most in-demand investment zones.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1754\" />', 'Apartment', 'Open', 'sale', 'Studio, 1,2 & 3BR', '1-3+', '1+', '1', '1+', 'Not specified', 'From 422', 'From 1,030,000', 'Business Bay', 'Dubai', 'United arab emirate', '<p data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1807\">Beach Access</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1851\">Crystal-Crowned Towers with Canal Views</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1877\">Indoor &amp; Outdoor Gyms</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1896\">Jogging Tracks</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1915\">Cycling Tracks</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1933\">Sports Courts</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1957\">Restaurants &amp; Caf&eacute;s</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1977\">Kids&rsquo; Play Area</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2000\">Healthcare Centers</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2033\">Retail &amp; Lifestyle Promenade</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2060\">Smart Home Integration</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2085\">High-Speed Elevators</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2124\">24/7 Security &amp; Concierge Services</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2148\">Underground Parking</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2185\">Landscaped Terraces &amp; Open Areas</p>', 'aimage_686a75eb52f415.11841671.jpg', 'aimage1_686a75eb554114.94757264.jpg', 'aimage2_686a75eb579763.62770061.jpg', 'aimage3_686a75eb586668.25318148.jpg', 'aimage4_686a75eb591976.96167921.jpg', '34', 'available', 'fimage_686a75eb593da7.12550702.jpg', 'fimage1_686a75eb59b6d8.98406980.jpg', 'fimage2_686a75eb5a7867.01178123.jpg', 'Not specified', '0', '06-Jul-2025',