(108, NULL, 'Azizi Riviera 60 – Waterfront Living in MBR City | Luxury Apartments by Azizi', '												Discover Azizi Riviera 60 in MBR City, Dubai – a premium residential tower offering studio, 1 & 2-bedroom apartments with stunning lagoon views. Experience French-Mediterranean inspired architecture, world-class amenities, retail boulevards, and serene waterfront living by Azizi Developments.\r\n\r\nDetailed Property Description \r\nAzizi Riviera 60 is a luxurious residential development located in the heart of Mohammed Bin Rashid City (MBR City), Dubai. Designed with a touch of French Riviera elegance, this tower blends modern architecture with a vibrant waterfront lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe community offers studios, 1-bedroom, and 2-bedroom apartments thoughtfully crafted with premium finishes, spacious layouts, and panoramic views of the crystal lagoon and city skyline.\r\n\r\nResidents of Riviera 60 enjoy access to a wide range of world-class amenities, including:\r\n\r\nInfinity swimming pools\r\n\r\nFully equipped gymnasium\r\n\r\nLandscaped gardens and walking trails\r\n\r\nRetail & dining outlets on the boulevard\r\n\r\nLeisure decks and children’s play areas\r\n\r\nLocated just minutes away from Downtown Dubai, Meydan One Mall, and Dubai International Airport, Azizi Riviera 60 offers the perfect blend of urban convenience and waterfront tranquility.\r\n\r\nIdeal for both investors and end-users, Riviera 60 promises strong rental yields and capital appreciation in one of Dubai’s most sought-after master communities.												', 'Apartment', '1 BHK', 'sale', '1', '2', '1', '1', '1', 'Not specified', '853', '1550000', 'Al Meydan Rd - Al Merkadh - Nad Al Sheba 1 - Dubai - United Arab Emirates', 'Dubai', 'Dubai', 'Crystal Lagoon\r\nSandy Beach Access\r\nInfinity Swimming Pool\r\nFully Equipped Gymnasium\r\nYoga Meditation Area\r\nLandscaped Gardens\r\nJogging  Cycling Tracks\r\nBBQ Area\r\nOutdoor Cinema\r\nChildren&rsquo;s Play Area\r\nRetail Outlets\r\nCafe Restaurants\r\nLeisure Decks\r\nLounge Area\r\n24-Hour Security\r\nConcierge Service\r\nCovered Parking\r\nZen Garden\r\nCommunity Park\r\nPet-Friendly Areas', 'WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-12_at_11_46_45_AM__1__26fadd63c5e6.jpg', 'WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-12_at_11_46_46_AM_17c9848d30ae.jpg', 'WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-12_at_11_46_47_AM_9c4a2392a89a.jpg', 'WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-12_at_11_46_48_AM_4a9dd2904546.jpg', 'WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-12_at_11_46_49_AM_10660b0f7048.jpg', '0', 'available', 'WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-12_at_11_46_49_AM__1__a4a98ec71ba7.jpg', 'WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-12_at_11_46_50_AM__1__1d82edd05a50.jpg', 'WhatsApp_Image_2025-11-12_at_11_46_50_AM_b151365d9827.jpg', '2 B + G + 8 + R', '0', '19-Nov-2025', '', '', '', 'Off Plan', '0', '506767', 'Furnished', '1', '1', '', '', '', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GaSCopPg0AbJJbsKoOgoZMm7ssWozX5f', '1', '0', 'razahasnain0300@gmail.com', ''),
